{"id": "unknown-2026-07-21-003", "date": "2026-07-21", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 30, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cotton_price", "order_visibility", "earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.75, "keywords": ["decline", "concerns"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["涉及財報", "情緒極端"]}, "title": "ICE cotton edges higher on weather concerns, stronger crude oil", "content": "ICE cotton futures edged higher after a two-day decline, supported by weather concerns, stronger crude oil prices and positive sentiment from China's state cotton reserve auction.\nHowever, profit booking limited gains, while light trading volume signalled cautious market sentiment.\nTraders continue to watch US weather, export demand, and Chinese reserve purchases for clearer direction.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/ice-cotton-edges-higher-on-weather-concerns-stronger-crude-oil-311906-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-21-004", "date": "2026-07-21", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 30, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift", "earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["growth"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Standard Chartered upgrades Vietnam's 2026 GDP growth outlook", "content": "Standard Chartered raised its forecast for Vietnam’s 2026 GDP growth to 9.5 per cent from 7.2 per cent earlier, citing stronger-than-expected recovery in manufacturing, investment and domestic consumption. \nThe adjustment follows positive economic performance in H1 2026, with growth drivers continuing to gain momentum. \nIt lowered its inflation forecast to 4.4 per cent for 2026 and 3.3 per cent for 2027. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/standard-chartered-upgrades-vietnam-s-2026-gdp-growth-outlook-311900-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
